<p>Changed your mind or noticed an address error? {% render 'policy-contact' %} immediately with your order number and the change requested.</p>
<h2 id="cancellation-window">A short cancellation window</h2>
<p>Trendsi may allow cancellation within <strong>24 hours of purchase</strong>, but approval is not guaranteed. Processing can begin sooner. Once an order is processing or has shipped, ordinary cancellation is unavailable. We check the order status and confirm whether the request was successful; sending a message alone does not cancel an order.</p>
<h2 id="cancellation-changes">Address &amp; order changes</h2>
<p>We cannot promise changes to an address, size, color or quantity after an order is placed. Please contact us immediately. Do not place a replacement order assuming the first order has been canceled.</p>
<h2 id="cancellation-refund">If cancellation is confirmed</h2>
<p>We refund the canceled order, or the applicable canceled portion, to the original payment method. Bank processing times vary. If processing has already started, eligible items may be returned after delivery under our <a href="/policies/refund-policy">refund &amp; returns policy</a>.</p>
<h2 id="cancellation-rights">Delayed or unavailable items</h2>
<p>The processing restriction does not limit your rights when we cannot ship as promised. We will offer the required delay or cancellation options, or cancel unavailable merchandise and promptly refund it. We will notify you if we cannot fulfill an order. See our <a href="/policies/shipping-policy">delivery policy</a>.</p>
